    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-news-release">News Release</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Fed President Patrick Harker Sees Two Possible Paths for U.S. Economy in Months Ahead </h1>


        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">07 May ’20</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">Describing the U.S. economy as in “good shape,” Patrick T. Harker, president and CEO of the Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia, said he thinks monetary policy should stay on hold.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


            </div>



        </div>


    </div>

</div>

